    "summary": "During the opposing turn, The Yncarne can use Inevitable Death once, provided it is already in play and a different friendly AELDARI unit dies. Lift The Yncarne and return it at the nearest position to the other unit’s last model that keeps it clear of enemy Engagement Range. The relocation leaves its movement eligibility intact.",
